From d14d4cabb0e027a3435855d4501eb2e161d2a575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Perf Fix <fix-bot@local>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 18:23:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix slow page loads: HTTP timeouts, Google Fonts blocking
 fetch, request_logs index

- GoogleFonts: 300s timeout -> 15s, add connectTimeout, negative cache for failed fetches
- MembershipAuthorization/Helper/Media/Location/Captcha/Webhooks/SocialLogin/Newsletter/ExchangeRates: add missing HTTP timeouts
- Core/MarketplaceService: reduce 100s connectTimeout to 15s
- request_logs: add composite index (url,status_code) via migration
- ClearCacheService: bump font failure-cache generation on manual clear
- .env.example: APP_DEBUG=false + documented performance env vars
